This repository adapts the upstream rounded-rectangle distance field, lens /
depth / chromatic-dispersion optics, highlights, color controls, shadows, and
Catalog Button / Toggle / Slider / BottomTabs interaction examples to Flutter.
See docs/SOURCES.md for source-file mappings and permanent upstream links.
The upstream baseline contains no root NOTICE file; this NOTICE records the
attribution and modifications of the Flutter distribution.

Flutter adaptations and additions
Copyright 2026 xiaomanjun233 and contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modified implementation: AGSL was adapted to Flutter GLSL and sampler2D input;
Flutter paint coordinates, GLES orientation guards, affine source transforms,
per-surface shader ownership, ordered composed / separate filters, explicit
background snapshots, background composition, and resource disposal were added.
Catalog gestures were adapted to Flutter animation, pointer, keyboard, and
semantics APIs. Rounded-corner geometry, highlight rendering, zero-dispersion
single-sample behavior, program prewarming, and retained control shells were
adapted or extended for the Flutter renderer.

The progressive Gaussian experiments, frame recorder, diagnostics, gallery,
tests, and Flutter background lifecycle are project additions, not features
supplied by the upstream 2.0.0 release.

